  "question": "Within 130 kilometers, where can I find a museum aligned with the route to Tappan Zee Hotel, Nyack, NY from White Memorial Foundation, Litchfield, CT?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.213489 41.724615)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.949654 41.096623)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'museum'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.213489 41.724615)',4326)::geography, 130000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.213489 41.724615)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
